.TH "GIT-PW SERIES APPLY" "1" "2026-10-15" "2.9.0" "git-pw series apply Manual"
.SH NAME
git-pw\-series\-apply \- Apply series.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B git-pw series apply
[OPTIONS] SERIES_ID [ARGS]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Apply series.
.PP
Apply a series locally using the 'git-am' command. Any additional ARGS
provided will be passed to the 'git-am' command.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-deps\fP / \-\-no\-deps
Download any dependencies this series may have, and apply themfirst.
